From: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: pcs: airoha: apply E2 calibration to PON PCS

The XR1710G 10G LAN path is wired through the AN7581 PON PCS instance,
but the E2 manual RX calibration and signal-detect recovery were enabled
only for the Ethernet PCS.  Apply the same revision-gated calibration
and existing RX-lock workaround to both external SerDes instances.

This is split from the original E2 calibration change so its silicon
threshold and its PON-specific integration can be reviewed separately.

Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-5.6-sol
Index: linux-6.18.44/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
===================================================================
--- linux-6.18.44.orig/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
+++ linux-6.18.44/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-airoha-common.c
@@ -1452,11 +1452,12 @@ static int airoha_pcs_probe(struct platf
 	if (IS_ERR(priv->xfi_rst))
 		return dev_err_probe(dev, PTR_ERR(priv->xfi_rst), "failed to get xfi reset lines\n");
 
-	/* For Ethernet PCS, read the AN7581 SoC revision to check if
-	 * manual rx calibration is needed. Extend the manual-calibration
-	 * threshold to include E2 silicon.
+	/* For the external Ethernet SerDes, read the AN7581 SoC revision to
+	 * check if manual RX calibration is needed. Extend the threshold to
+	 * include E2 silicon.
 	 */
-	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-eth")) {
+	if (device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-eth") ||
+	    device_is_compatible(dev, "airoha,an7581-pcs-pon")) {
 		u32 val;
 
 		ret = regmap_read(priv->scu, AIROHA_SCU_PDIDR, &val);
@@ -1537,6 +1538,7 @@ static const struct airoha_pcs_match_dat
 	.usxgmii_ber_time_fixup = true,
 	.alloc_regmap_fields = an7581_pcs_alloc_regmap_fields,
 	.bringup = an7581_pcs_bringup,
+	.rxlock_workaround = an7581_pcs_rxlock_workaround,
 };
 
 static const struct airoha_pcs_match_data an7581_pcs_pcie = {
Index: linux-6.18.44/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
===================================================================
--- linux-6.18.44.orig/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
+++ linux-6.18.44/drivers/net/pcs/airoha/pcs-an7581.c
@@ -1797,8 +1797,8 @@ retry_calibration:
 
 	an7581_pcs_cdr_reset(priv, index, interface, false);
 
-	/* Manual RX calibration is required only for SoC before E2
-	 * revision. E2+ SoC autocalibrate RX and only CDR reset is needed.
+	/* Manual RX calibration is required for SoC revisions through E2.
+	 * E3+ SoCs autocalibrate RX and only CDR reset is needed.
 	 */
 	if (!priv->manual_rx_calib)
 		return 0;
